    {
      "component_id": "c_023",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Really a classic! The Wrap Cross Carry is easy to handle and adjustable as well. It can be tied with one layer or multilayered. So, it can also be used for newborns as well as for toddlers with a higher weight, due to the supporting options. + The wrap cross underneath the pouch offers wrapping beginners additional security. The fabric can be fanned out over the shoulders to spread out the weight optimally. - The diagonal strap can press uncomfortably onto your breastsy. Facts Base Size (Size 6) Level: Easy Usable: From birth",
