    {
      "component_id": "c_032",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "A Ring Sling is an all-rounder without knots which can be used right from birth for babies or for toddlers as well. A Ring Sling can be used for front-, back- or hip carrying techniques. + A Ring Sling can be pre-tied. It is easily usable for all babies. The fabric can be tightened easily due to the two sewn-in rings made of aluminum. - One-shoulder carrying techniques put weight only on one shoulder and are only an additional carrying method. Facts Ring Sling Level: Easy Usable: From birth",
