    {
      "component_id": "c_041",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Be flexible with your Wrap Conversion FIDELLA Fly Tai! This baby carrier can be used for different carrying methods: for front-, hip- and back carrying. The Fly Tai can be closed, due to its long straps, with lovely finishes. The shoulder straps can be fanned out to spread out the weight of your child all over your back. + Fix the Mei Tai as flexible as you like - classically (for small babies) or \"reinforced\" (from sitting age). Due to the shoulder straps, which can be fanned out, you can spread out the weight of your child optimally. - This baby carrier has long straps. Somebody who does not like this should take a Full-Buckle baby carrier - our Fusion. Please take care of the correct size for your baby! Facts Size: Baby Size, New Size and Toddler Size Level: Easy \u200bUsable: From birth",
      "content_desc": "",
