    {
      "component_id": "c_050",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "A FIDELLA Fusion is a full-buckle baby carrier, totally made of wrap fabric, which is closed with buckles at hip and shoulders. It can be used as a front or back carrier. Thanks to the buckles, this carrier can be adjusted to baby wearing person and baby perfectly. The buckles can be fixed to the hip belt (from birth) or to the back panel (if your baby is can sit unassisted). + The carrier is easily adjustable, due to the belt straps. Full-Buckle systems are prefered from baby wearing dads. - The carrier has to be adjusted repeatedly to the baby wearing person. Please pay attention to the correct size for your baby! Facts Size: Baby Size and Toddler Size Level: Easy Usable: From birth (Baby Size), from the 5th month (Toddler Size)",
