      "component_id": "c_068",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "The Simple Rucksack is the classic of all back carrying techniques with a baby wrap. This one-layer wrapping technique is the base for various other wrapping techniques. It can be used with newborns by pre-tying the wrap. + You have to practice binding a baby wrap a little bit to be successful. - You have to practice a little bit this binding technique to bring the baby onto your back. The carrying consultant who is close to you may help you with your first attempts. Everything else you can prepare while using our Carry-Me-App. Facts Base Size -3 (Size 3) Level: Easy Usable: From birth",
