      "component_id": "c_077",
      "class": "android.widget.TextView",
      "text": "Elegant wrapping techniques for hip carrying make the Jacquard weaving technique of your FIDELLA baby wrap appear much more intensive. You should choose one-layer binding techniques, e.g. the Hip Loop, for newborns. You can choose techniques like the Poppins Hip Carry for children who have reached sitting age. + This wrapping technique is a fast solution for hip carrying and a real eye-catcher. - One-sided tying techniques are not suitable for long walks because they overstrain just one shoulder. Facts Base Size -2 (Size 4) Level: Easy Usable: From birth / sitting age",
